@startuml state_station
!pragma layout smetana
title Station state machine (checked against src/core/station_fsm.cpp by tests/test_uml_sync.cpp)
hide empty description

[*] --> Idle

state Active {
  state Moving
  state Settling
  state Acquiring
  state Processing
  Moving --> Settling : Arrived
  Settling --> Acquiring : Settled
  Acquiring --> Processing : FrameReceived
}

Idle --> Moving : Start
Processing --> Idle : ResultReady
Active --> Error : Timeout / Fault
Active --> Idle : Stop
Error --> Idle : Reset

note right of Settling
  Controller mode: blocks on SETTLE (in-position for 5 ms).
  "none" mode passes straight through: the frame is
  exposed while the stage is still ringing.
end note
note right of Error
  Recovery: reconnect stage if dropped,
  RESET (hold position), re-read POS,
  then Reset -> Idle and continue the plan.
end note
@enduml
